INSERT INTO `vendor_medicine_information` VALUES (35,49,'PR01','1/a/3, plot, 9-63, no 20, road no. 3, brindavan colony, boduppal, hyderabad, telangana 500092',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Pragna Bilva Leaf Powder is an ayurvedic remedy for digestive issues. It effectively treats common digestive disorders including gastritis, stomach ulcers and boosts energy levels. It regulates and maintains blood sugar levels, making it a beneficial remedy for diabetic patients. It purifies the blood and removes toxins which makes it a complete beneficial tonic for kidneys and liver. | Key Ingredients: Bilva Leaf | Key Benefits: Primarily used for the treatment of digestive disorders Provides effective relief from gastric ulcers and boosts energy levels in the body Beneficial remedy for diabetic patients and it regulates blood sugar levels Helps relieve ear ache Removes impurities and toxins from the blood and improves kidney health | Directions for use: Dried fruit powder can be consumed with honey or as directed by the physician. | Safety Information: A dietary supplement not intended for medicinal use Read the label carefully before use Do not exceed the recommended dose Keep out of the reach of children Store in a cool dry place away from direct sunlight and heat',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'200 gm Powder','2026-04-28 17:54:27'),(36,50,'JE01','Jeevan Organics, New Delhi',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1 Kit','2026-04-28 17:54:27'),(37,51,'VA01','Ashtavaidyan Thaikkattu Mooss Vaidyaratnam Oushadhasala (P) Ltd, Ollur, Thaikkattussery, Thrissur, Kerala - 680 306',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Vaidyaratnam Oushadha Soap is a natural transparent soap, suitable for all skin type. | Key Ingredients: Sodium Cocoate Sodium Stearate Tera Sodium EDTA Castor Oil Glycerin Herbal Extract Moisturizer BHT Perfume | Key Benefits: It gently cleanses the skin and keeps your skin moisturized all the time Prevents skin problems such as dryness, scaling etc. It prevents the skin from developing wrinkles Promotes glowing and healthy looking skin | Directions For Use: Use daily during bathing | Safety Information: Read the label carefully before use Keep out of the reach of children Store in a cool and dry place, away from sunlight For external use only',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'75 gm Soap','2026-04-28 17:54:27'),(38,52,'JA01','15-9-472, Siddiamber Bazar, Hyderabad - 500012, Telangana, (INDIA)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Jain Methi Powder contains Methi (Fenugreek) as the main ingredient. Key benefits/uses of Jain Methi Powder: - Methi (Fenugreek) is useful for anemia, pregnancy, lactation, diabetes, digestion, loss of taste, fever, hair care, dandruff, stomach disorders, biliousness, respiratory disorders, mouth ulcers, sore throat, diabetes, inflammations, wounds and insomnia - Fenugreek is used to treat wounds, inflammation and gastrointestinal ailments - Helps to enhance feminine beauty it also aids in sexual stimulation, balances blood sugar levels, and contains choline which aids the thinking process - Ability to balance hormone levels aids in treating PMS and menopause - Acts as antioxidants which help in slow aging and help prevent disease Direction for use/Dosage: - Take 3 to 5 gm of Jain Methi Powder once or twice a day Indications: - Anemia, pregnancy, lactation, diabetes, digestion, loss of taste, fever, hair care, dandruff, stomach disorders, biliousness, respiratory disorders, mouth ulcers, sore throat, diabetes, inflammations, wounds and insomnia Storage instructions: - Store the formulation in cool and dry place Safety information: - Read the label carefully before use - Do not exceed the recommended dose - Keep out of the reach and sight of children',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'50 gm Powder','2026-04-28 17:54:27'),(39,53,'HI01','Makali, Bengaluru, KA, 562 162, India',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Himalaya Personal Care Fresh Start Oil Clear Face Wash is designed to enhance the appearance of facial skin. The ingredients present in the product encompasses skin-conditioning, astringent, antioxidant properties. | Key Ingredients: The key ingredients are as mentioned in the variants. | Key Benefits: Blueberry contains a rich store of nutrients and antioxidants that exhibit skin-conditioning properties Indian Gooseberry embodies astringent properties and helps to reduce excess skin oiliness. The tannins act as free radical scavengers Lemon is widely used in cosmetics for its great skin-conditioning properties. It has refreshing and astringent properties which help to reduce excess facial oil Peach encompasses skin-conditioning properties and restores skin softness and suppleness Strawberry is known to possess skin-conditioning properties. Strawberry helps to enhance the appearance of facial skin | Directions For Use: Apply the face wash on a moist face and massage. Gently work up a lather using a circular motion. Wash off and pat dry. Use twice daily. | Safety Information: Read the label carefully before use Store in a cool dry place away from direct sunlight Keep out of reach of the children',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'200 ml Face Wash','2026-04-28 17:54:27'),(40,54,'SB01','SBL, House 2 ,Commercial Complex, Shrestah Vihar,Delhi 10092,INDIA',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SBL Spigelia is a homeopathic medicine which comprises of genuine raw materials which keeps it free from impurities. It helps in treating palpitation and reduces pain caused due to migraine. | Key Ingredients: Extract of spegelia plant Ethanol Water | Key Benefits: It is an excellent remedy for angina Cures dizziness and treats restlessness Cures vertigo, nausea and headaches Heals neuralgia of eyes Reduces toothache Cures sore throat Treats urine with white sedimentation Cures abdominal pains Eases nerve pains | Directions For Use: Dosage should be prescribed by the physician | Safety Information: Read the label carefully Self medication is not advised Do not exceed the recommended dose Keep out of the reach of children Avoid any kind of strong smell in the mouth while taking the dose',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'20 gm Globules','2026-04-28 17:54:27'),(41,55,'SA01','c-1/604, 1st floor palam vihar gurgaon hr 122017 in',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Safe-O-Kid Unique High Density L-Shaped 2mtr Long Guard Strip is designed for protecting the kids from sharp edges while retaining its flexibility and softness for enhanced protection. Safe-O-Kid\'s special adhesive does not come off easily and does not leave stains/damage furniture/paint. It provides 100 percent safety from dangerous accidents. | Uses: It is used to protect the kids from edgy and sharp corners. | Product Specifications and Features: The product is premium edge guard and effectively covers the sharp edges while retaining its flexibility and softness for enhanced protection It is thoroughly tested for high impact collisions (do not rupture) It is the best quality adhesives (do not come off easily yet do not leave stain/damage furniture/paint) It is non-toxic, eco-friendly, odourless, dust-free and does not become sticky on prolonged use even in Indian heat The product is flame retardant/ fire and water resistance It is easy to install, remove, and is reusable Best Suited For: Sharp edges made of glass, metal, wood including tables, chairs, beds, drawer u,nits,fish tanks, chests/cabinets, nightstands, and shelves Sharp edges of fixed constructions like stairs, low ceilings, plumbing fittings Ideal Places: Home, schools, daycares, preschools, hospitals, assisted living facilities, senior housing, work areas, offices, museums, restaurants and hotels | Directions For Use: Clean the corner surface as well as Safe-o-Kids Corner Cushions inner surfaces using any ordinary home cleaning solution and wipe it dry Peel off the yellow backing layer of the double-sided 3M tape provided with the Corner Cushion Apply the tape to all four inner surfaces of corner cushion Align the tape with the edges of the Corner Cushion Remove the 3M backings from the four pieces of tape applied to the Corner Cushions inner surfaces Carefully align so the Corner Cushion fits perfectly with the corners surface without leaving any space Press tightly and hold Corner Cushion against the surface for at least one minute How To Remove: Start removing Corner Cushion carefully from any of the edges. DO NOT use any chemicals/sharp tools Clean the surface with a wet cloth, etc. as suitable | Safety Information: Read the label carefully before use Store in a cool dry place away from direct sunlight Keep out of reach of the children Avoid physical damage',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1 Unit','2026-04-28 17:54:27'),(42,56,'SA02','c-1/604, 1st floor palam vihar gurgaon hr 122017 in',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Safe-O-Kid Adjustable Multi-Purpose Child Safety Lock prevents children\'s fingers from accidently gettign caught in the doors and cabinets. It is easy to install and remove and is made from quality material. | Uses: It protects children from harm caused by fingers getting caught into drawers and ensures safety of your children around gas stoves. | Product Specifications and Features: It is reusable and its lock and tape are made of best quality material It can be used for multiple purposes and is adjustable, fits all shapes and has elegant design It can be easily operated by adults but is tricky for kids | Directions For Use: Read the user manual for directions. | Safety Information: This product is not a substitute for adult supervision, make sure gas knob is removed and replaced properly Use help if you are not confident, always close the upper lid when gas knob is not to be used so as to avoid children from using it Always double check that gas knob has been turned to off position when gas is not in use Never put the guard near direct flames and stop using immediately if the guard is interfering with regular operation of the gas knob Read the label carefully before use',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'12 units','2026-04-28 17:54:27'),(43,57,'SA03','c-1/604, 1st floor palam vihar gurgaon hr 122017 in',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Safe-O-Kid High Density L-Shaped Nbr Corner Cushions S is a premium corner cushion for protecting the kids from sharp edges while retaining its flexibility and softness for enhanced protection. Safe-O-Kid\'s special adhesive does not come off easily and does not leave stains/damage furniture/paint. It provides 100 percent safety from dangerous accidents. | Uses: It is used to protect the kids from edgy and sharp corners. | Product Specification and Features: Non-toxic, eco-friendly, odorless, dust-free, and does not become sticky with prolonged use even in extremely hot weather Flame retardant/fire and water resistant Easy to install and remove and is reusable Vast array of color and design choices to blend with furniture and/or room theme Best Suited For: Sharp edges made of glass, metal, wood including tables, chairs, beds, drawer u,nits,fish tanks, chests/cabinets, nightstands, and shelves Sharp edges of fixed constructions like stairs, low ceilings, plumbing fittings Ideal Places: Home, schools, daycares, preschools, hospitals, assisted living facilities, senior housing, work areas, offices, museums, restaurants and hotels | Directions For Use Clean the corner surface as well as Safe-o-Kids Corner Cushions inner surfaces using any ordinary home cleaning solution and wipe it dry Peel off the yellow backing layer of the double-sided 3M tape provided with the Corner Cushion Apply the tape to all four inner surfaces of corner cushion Align the tape with the edges of the Corner Cushion Remove the 3M backings from the four pieces of tape applied to the Corner Cushions inner surfaces Carefully align so the Corner Cushion fits perfectly with the corners surface without leaving any space Press tightly and hold Corner Cushion against the surface for at least one minute How To Remove: Start removing Corner Cushion carefully from any of the edges. DO NOT use any chemicals/sharp tools Clean the surface with a wet cloth, etc. as suitable | Safety Information: Read the label carefully before use Keep out of reach of the children',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'16 units','2026-04-28 17:54:27'),(44,58,'HA01',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Hahnemann Labs Calcintone Tonic is a homeopathic formulation available in the form of a tonic. It is specially formulated for children. It is a reservoir of calcium and helps to promote the growth and development of bones in children. Calcium which is an active ingredient in the product enables our blood to clot, our muscles to contract, and our heart to beat. Key Ingredients: Calcium Key Benefits: Helps to provide the child with calcium which helps in the growth of bones and muscles Assists in the strengthening of bones in the body Helps maintain natural processes in the body such as clotting of bood and contraction of muscles Does not contain any added chemicals or additives Directions For Use: Take Hahnemann Labs Calcintone Tonic as directed by the physician Safety Information: Read the label carefully before use Keep out of the reach of children Do not exceed the recommended dose',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'100 gm Tonic','2026-04-28 17:54:27'),(45,59,'GA01','Noida',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'60 gm Capsule','2026-04-28 17:55:19'),(46,60,'GA02','Noida',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'60 gm Capsule','2026-04-28 17:56:16'),(47,61,'GA03','Noida',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'60 gm Capsule','2026-04-28 17:58:26'),(48,62,'GA01','Arysus','https://res.cloudinary.com/dxoy1r7v8/image/upload/v1777399209/uploads/ysplemvogauqfw4rvbzq.jpg','https://res.cloudinary.com/dxoy1r7v8/image/upload/v1777399209/uploads/oqfybgzew2p3lsezz8lg.jpg','https://res.cloudinary.com/dxoy1r7v8/image/upload/v1777399209/uploads/t3stbi6ej33copuzlltv.jpg','https://res.cloudinary.com/dxoy1r7v8/image/upload/v1777399209/uploads/ggabbe7mojxrfvqea677.jpg','https://res.cloudinary.com/dxoy1r7v8/image/upload/v1777399209/uploads/e5pkfg7s02znymg0ifun.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'60 gm Capsule','2026-04-28 18:00:08');
